EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}I'm sorry.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} I worked really hard to
get that, so{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}it's not for sale.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I hope you understand.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Mi dispiace,{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} non è in vendita.
{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}È stato difficile procurarmi
quel gioiellino.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Spero che capirai.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Üzgünüm.{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Onu elde etmek için gerçekten
çok uğraştım, bu yüzden{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}satılık değil.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Umarım anlarsın.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Oh, tesoro!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} No, non è in vendita.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Quell'oggetto è come un figlio
per me.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Mi capisci, vero?

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Oh weh.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Das ist leider unverkäuflich.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Das ist aber auch gar kein Mobiliar,
sondern mein geliebtes Haustier!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Je ne peux pas te céder ça, désolée.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Si tu savais ce qu'il a fallu endurer
pour mettre mes pattes là-dessus...

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Onu neden istediğini anlıyorum,{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}} ama elde
etmek için çok uğraştım.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Ondan vazgeçemem.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Bas les pattes ! {{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}Euh, je veux dire :{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
désolée, mais je ne peux pas m'en
séparer.{{TAG:0003:0025:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Lo siento mucho, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}pero le tengo
mucho cariño a eso y no quiero
desprenderme de ello.{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Scusa,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ma questo oggetto
mi è molto caro{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} e non riesco
